      (hH D HW F Cm CA CB CK hA) hMF hU1 (hkp D HW F Cm CA CB CK hA) (hU2 D HW F Cm CA CB CK hA)
      (hD D HW F Cm CA CB CK hA hMF) (hUp D HW F Cm CA CB CK hA hMF) (hMx D HW F Cm CA CB CK hA hdr hrk hMF)
